cloud offering you should use

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.290
in which scenario and what you
should think about when looking

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:42.300
at an enterprise migration.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.400
With all of the
sessions this week,

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.700
